[{"title":"某辛巳秋归自武林省先陇遂修亭宇浚溪流因思先人旧诗已随屋璧坏矣尚能记忆遂追和 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"丘木森森已十围，满林清荫可栖依。\n每忧樵牧伤松柏，游宦三年两度归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17724,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送万先之赴清湘教官","author":"王十朋","text":"早岁声名满上庠，青衫今始赴清湘。\n得官已晚岂宜冷，行路正难那更长。\n平昔心期良不浅，异时官业可能量。\n鹏程九万从今日，行见飞飞到帝旁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17725,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送曹梦良赴桐庐户掾 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"年少论交老愈坚，交情尽在和韩篇。\n短檠业共贤关舍，淡墨名同桂籍年。\n筮仕暂为三语掾，摛词行践八花砖。\n许峰佳谶亦聊耳，何止蓬莱山上仙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17726,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送曹梦良赴桐庐户掾 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"鸡黍相寻岂偶然，论文尊酒荷留连。\n秋风初送雁群至，乔木喜闻莺友迁。\n劝我鉴湖行甚力，送君钓濑去无缘。\n愿将清白师韩范，从此高堂有四贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17727,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送曹梦良赴桐庐户掾 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"需次家乡五载迟，便便腹笥愈添围。\n才如子建岂论斗，性类西门能佩韦。\n车马戒涂君欲去，田园迷径我初归。\n男儿所尚惟名节，莫堕人间富贵机。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17728,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十月朔日偶书","author":"王十朋","text":"去年此日对清光，圣德能容一介狂。\n言略施行非不遇，身虽疏外亦何妨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17729,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剪拂花木戏成二绝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"洒扫衡茅端欲老，剪裁花木自为春。\n权门炙手非吾事，祇合丘园作散人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17730,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"剪拂花木戏成二绝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"蔓草芟夷莫许侵，好花封植待成阴。\n每于小小园林里，长抱惓惓畎亩心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17731,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"小小园十月杜鹃花盛开有共蒂双头之异因以数语记之","author":"王十朋","text":"一声杜宇啼春风，明朝绯挂千山丛。\n岁寒此色岂易得，那更朵朵双头红。\n共蒂联芳友于爱，一吐一含分次第。\n造物私我小园林，此花大胜金腰带。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17732,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题月师桂堂","author":"王十朋","text":"道人以月名身，以桂名堂。\n胸中负所有，志在丹霄旁。\n冠巾倘可加，唾手得天香。\n惜哉已世外，此志终莫偿。\n山中作堂侔月窟，禅定吟馀思清越。\n要令坐上生清风，须使心中似明月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17733,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十一月二日自金溪访钱用章于白石览山川景物之奇以东道之姓为韵","author":"王十朋","text":"朝离文君故宅边，莫寻谢守旧行田。\n黄羊先示神仙迹，白石俄开洞府天。\n两派?峥鸣玉涧，一声欸乃钓鱼船。\n王孙占得湖山胜，明月清风不计钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17734,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同钱用明用章游白石岩","author":"王十朋","text":"谢公好山水，得郡古东瓯。\n造物惜佳境，雅志多不酬。\n松萝蔽雁荡，烟霭埋龙湫。\n行田经白石，不到仙山头。\n寥寥数百年，天付黄冠流。\n巍然万仞崖，壁立东南州。\n谁将补天手，化出白玉楼。\n两龛藏洞府，中有群仙游。\n上通尺五天，下接三神洲。\n飞泉落岩腰，碧涧鸣山陬。\n群峰真培塿，沧海为渠沟。\n隘视人间世，万象同蜉蝣。\n我家雁山阳，崎岖厌经丘。\n翩翩钱公子，呼我寻岩幽。\n初惊小雨密，忽扫群阴浮。\n杖屦穷巑岏，一洗尘埃眸。\n山林有真乐，富贵何足求。\n但愿乞二山，不愿万户侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17735,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又书岩上","author":"王十朋","text":"十里湖山翠黛横，两溪寒玉斗琮琤。\n路从飞鸟上头过，人在白云高处行。\n岩下行田谢康乐，洞中辟谷李先生。\n凭栏不瞰人间世，转觉此心名利轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17736,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"屑玉泉","author":"王十朋","text":"白石岩腰屑玉泉，佳名初自长官传。\n浑疑齿颊冰霜论，终日霏霏落半天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17737,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李少和像","author":"王十朋","text":"少和辛苦学飞仙，遗像今犹在洞天。\n都似先生能辟谷，何须太守为行田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17738,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游东际","author":"王十朋","text":"白石三峰下，悬崖七际流。\n穿云来汩汩，朝海去悠悠。\n石是谁家妇，龙居第几湫。\n平生不行险，到此即回头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17739,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宝印叔观海三绝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"载地浮天浩莫穷，气营楼阁耸虚空。\n道人妙得观澜术，万里沧溟碧眼中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17740,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宝印叔观海三绝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"榴屿何年改玉环，望中犹是旧青山。\n遗民不记当时事，惟有潮声日往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17741,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵宝印叔观海三绝 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"误入蓬莱朝未央，至今魂梦记微茫。\n扁舟欲效鸱夷子，遥望沧波兴已狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17742,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李镇夫辟圃筑堂效孟氏之养吾表兄杖屦其间得日涉之趣某来游名堂曰双植因书三绝 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"不到君家几换春，眼中风物一番新。\n吾园小小知何用，不似兹园可养亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17743,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李镇夫辟圃筑堂效孟氏之养吾表兄杖屦其间得日涉之趣某来游名堂曰双植因书三绝 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"琴书得趣有真乐，轩冕倘来何足干。\n种德种花兼著力，要须留与子孙看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17744,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李镇夫辟圃筑堂效孟氏之养吾表兄杖屦其间得日涉之趣某来游名堂曰双植因书三绝 其三","author":"王十朋","text":"绕堂花木随宜种，堆案文书取次翻。\n我待衣冠挂林下，杖藜时复到君园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17745,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘长方自豫章寄书称砮焦蛎房之美恨未知味书一绝以寄之","author":"王十朋","text":"珠屿小蛎圆带石，砮焦巨房深若杯。\n吾乡此味亦不恶，故人游宦盍归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17746,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝印叔得小假山以长篇模写进士钦逢辰和之某次韵并简钦","author":"王十朋","text":"越绝天台温雁荡，万壑千岩各形状。\n钱塘风物更奇绝，杖屦年时记曾访。\n归来戏辟小园林，十里西湖藏瓮盎。\n悠然入眼皆吾山，罗列轩窗一何壮。\n止庵道人真有道，种竹莳花近丘圹。\n何人好事赠假山，潜涧新添小屏嶂。\n却疑迁徙从平泉，更恐飞来自秦望。\n世间赝物何止此，沙佛儒衣龙亦象。\n道人于物意岂留，异日从教散天壤。\n花木篇章两游戏，林下高风真可尚。\n来游莲社有诗人，句比昌黎更豪放。\n我休说假复论真，真假通同归一相。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17747,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其一 黄杨藓复有生意","author":"王十朋","text":"黄杨庚甲与吾同，树已萧疏我亦翁。\n藤蔓稍除苔藓去，岁寒犹解傲霜风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17748,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其二 莆萄","author":"王十朋","text":"满架龙须卷复伸，堆盘马乳酿青春。\n泼醅一斗宜延客，莫博凉州学汉人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17749,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其三 脩竹","author":"王十朋","text":"至乐斋西碧玉竿，清阴时过酒杯寒。\n明年看长纤纤笋，解箨当为汉帝冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17750,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其四 梅","author":"王十朋","text":"拂云脩竹绕吾家，竹里仍栽第一花。\n好句更同林处士，月黄昏后影横斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17751,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其五 桃","author":"王十朋","text":"欲留王母盘中核，兼采秦人洞里薪。\n此事渺茫花笑我，不如聊赏故园春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17752,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其六 李","author":"王十朋","text":"长念诗人咏子嗟，团栾绕树日攲斜。\n冰盘行荐炎天实，不用东门学种瓜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17753,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其七 杉","author":"王十朋","text":"记得先人手自栽，森然千尺尽成材。\n翠丝结作思人树，它日儿孙岂忍摧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17754,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其八 桂","author":"王十朋","text":"丹霄休叹路难通，学取燕山种桂丛。\n异日天香满亭院，吾庐当似广寒宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17755,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其九 柳","author":"王十朋","text":"何幸先人有弊庐，不妨同种柳千株。\n垂阴覆地宁无日，作雪漫天肯似榆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17756,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵昌龄西园十咏 其十 菊","author":"王十朋","text":"百花春放菊秋荣，霜里鲜鲜照眼明。\n岁晚不妨开自好，何须三嗅泣繁英。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17757,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题如存亭壁 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"不见慈亲已一星，佳城松柏惨然青。\n此生难报劬劳德，空对铭碑涕泗零。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17758,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题如存亭壁 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"年来游宦远松楸，越雪吴霜带满头。\n乞得祠宫养衰病，白岩香火共僧修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17759,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘义夫欲与先陇植兰寄数根","author":"王十朋","text":"思亲何忍陟南陔，采得幽兰祇自哀。\n寄与东山刘孝子，佳城侧畔好亲栽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17760,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义夫许赠丁香蜡梅","author":"王十朋","text":"刘郎不独种桃花，蜡蕊柔香更可嘉。\n臭味相同林下友，从今花木亦通家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17761,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"义夫以赵清献谏垣集易柳文次其韵","author":"王十朋","text":"文集何须较少多，有无相易共渐磨。\n宪台清献柳州柳，唐宋人才未易过。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17762,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁山僧景暹求文记本觉殿","author":"王十朋","text":"归来欲效老夫潜，喜见游方旧杜暹。\n本觉殿成功德满，愧无笔力助庄严。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17763,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又六言","author":"王十朋","text":"笔下何曾有口，囊中更愧无钱。\n聊把一言赞叹，助成此段因缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17764,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"人日有雪竹间种兰","author":"王十朋","text":"人日又飞雪，竹林仍种兰。\n阳浮屑琼玖，风泛馥檀栾。\n花点黄金胜，丛依碧玉竿。\n世间桃李眼，肯向此中看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17765,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张思豫主簿送丹桂蜡梅 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"通家天上张公子，桂种遥分月窟香。\n三径殷勤自栽植，异时会见五枝芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17766,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"张思豫主簿送丹桂蜡梅 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"莲幕何人送此花，不容一蕊污贫家。\n归来自觅清河种，馨德如人最可嘉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17767,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余全之赠菊栽二十品并示三十绝走笔二绝酬之 其一","author":"王十朋","text":"老觉山林兴味长，归来三径叹荒凉。\n分君嘉菊二十品，增我东园十八香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17768,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"余全之赠菊栽二十品并示三十绝走笔二绝酬之 其二","author":"王十朋","text":"余郎萧洒似何郎，事业它年未易量。\n寄我新诗三十绝，笔头直与菊争芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17769,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"二月二日焚黄天色开霁宾游并集存没有光悲痛之馀因成鄙语","author":"王十朋","text":"三釜深悲不逮亲，九天命下贲双坟。\n痛将泪杂香醪奠，忍见衣随告墨焚。\n漠漠浓阴初阁雨，晖晖煖日旋披云。\n馀生难报劬劳德，犹有孤忠可报君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17770,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送陈元佐游剡","author":"王十朋","text":"杖屦昔游剡，梦魂犹至今。\n欣闻戒行李，遥访旧同襟。\n敩学功相半，渊源力可寻。\n池中神鲤足，时为寄乡音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17771,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双桂","author":"王十朋","text":"先人植双桂，馨德满吾庐。\n不老儿孙长，联芳合似渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17772,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东篱","author":"王十朋","text":"我岂规彭泽，兹篱偶在东。\n悠然见山处，仍向菊花丛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17773,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其一 东高山","author":"王十朋","text":"峰头日出已停午，山半云横疑在天。\n要使名如越山重，直须人似谢公贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17774,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其二 西高山","author":"王十朋","text":"压顶花枝红欲燎，导前旌节闹如诃。\n倚窗拄颊时时好，何止朝来爽气多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17775,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其三 南高山","author":"王十朋","text":"山后风来闻县鼓，荡中秋至集宾鸿。\n我归种菊东篱下，长在悠然眼界中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17776,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其四 北高山","author":"王十朋","text":"群山如囿秀回环，秀拔群山是北山。\n我恐山中猿鹤怨，移文未至已先还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17777,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其五 龟山","author":"王十朋","text":"众山环绕一山横，形似真龟势欲行。\n不向九江资纳锡，临溪曳尾自全生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17778,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其六 卧虎山","author":"王十朋","text":"昂然虎踞一原东，回首眈眈气象雄。\n不放众山随逝水，溪头高卧自威风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17779,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其七 梅溪","author":"王十朋","text":"我向梅花溪上家，几看清浅浸横斜。\n手栽木已如人老，雪鬓萧疏对雪花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17780,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其八 杨溪","author":"王十朋","text":"一涧泓澄会众流，脉分俄类婺溪头。\n临溪更种青青木，故事端同柳柳州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17781,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其九 戏綵岩","author":"王十朋","text":"烟霞屏障列西岑，戏綵标名自始今。\n我过岩前每流涕，斑衣空有老莱心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17782,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十 杜鹃岩","author":"王十朋","text":"游宦三年乐事违，岩花笑我鸟催归。\n归来又被岩花笑，笑我登岩何太稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17783,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十一 棋盘岩","author":"王十朋","text":"杜鹃岩北一拳石，石面平平堪弈棋。\n路僻山深罕人到，烂柯仙客未应知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17784,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十二 撒水岩","author":"王十朋","text":"龙卧灵湫志未伸，时时喷水撒行人。\n虽然未救苍生旱，聊欲澄清世上尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17785,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十三 松罗岩","author":"王十朋","text":"插天万仞绝攀跻，岩顶松罗不是栽。\n廊庙须材作梁栋，人间斤斧可能来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17786,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十四 障岩","author":"王十朋","text":"岩如法吏面清泠，石似端人真直方。\n谁解移兹障边境，犬羊安敢肆猖狂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17787,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十五 人面岩","author":"王十朋","text":"看尽人间古与今，苍颜一任藓苔侵。\n岂惟有面如人面，更喜无心似兽心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17788,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十六 天柱岩","author":"王十朋","text":"雁山一柱插云霄，三井松罗柱亦高。\n蓬荜深怀杞人念，擎天端赖柱坚牢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17789,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十七 幞头岩","author":"王十朋","text":"闹处身宜及早抽，山林迟我挂冠游。\n不须花里寻腰带，且向田间置幞头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17790,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十八 宋家尖","author":"王十朋","text":"皇恩西被复东渐，四海苍生尽仰瞻。\n畎亩微臣尤戴宋，结庐长向此峰尖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17791,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其十九 小雁荡","author":"王十朋","text":"归雁行飞集涧阿，不贪江海稻粱多。\n峰头一荡虽然小，饮啄犹堪避网罗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17792,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"左原诗三十二首 其二十 左岭","author":"王十朋","text":"北望吾庐山最好，南通萧寺境逾幽。\n白云夜向原中宿，几度随人过岭头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":17793,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]